#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""
CodeEfficiencyAnalyzer v21.0 – Expanded AI Suggestions, Added TypeScript, Robust JS Fixes
Improvements:
- Expanded AI code suggestions: More heuristics + basic pattern-based LLM simulation (torch stub or rule-based)
- Added TypeScript support: tree-sitter-typescript, autofix via eslint --fix + ts-specific patches
- Made JS fixes more robust: Use tree-sitter AST traversal + escodegen-like unparse (stub), better vuln detection, validation after patch
- Configurable AI depth via YAML (light / medium / heavy)
"""

